        "node_id": "n_3_85e60c",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): To determine the relationship between the two melodies, check if the second melody is a transposition, retrograde, or inversion of the first melody. If none of these conditions are met, conclude that the relationship is \"Nonsense.\" Ensure that the transposition check correctly calculates the new notes by shifting them up by the appropriate number of semitones.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
